{"id": "approved-after-the-fact", "title": "Hundreds of contracts reached the Board after they had already begun", "seconds": 130.6, "voice": "elevenlabs:exurTFaGNF2gnRcPNH8I", "narrator": "Phil", "tempo": 1.136, "made": "2026-11-24", "key": "8e01c78877b347f4", "words": 423, "beats": [{"scene": "open", "kind": "sfmap", "ref": ["story[0]"], "text": "In San Francisco, big contracts need a yes from the Board of Supervisors… before the work starts.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 5.4, "shot": "b0", "visual": {"type": "sfmap", "pins": [{"place": "cityhall", "name": "Board of Supervisors", "sub": "votes here"}], "zoomOn": "board", "scale": 1.9, "kicker": "San Francisco"}, "emph": ["before"], "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.33, 1.28, 1.54, 2.04, 2.2, 2.28, 2.53, 2.69, 2.81, 3.04, 3.13, 3.92, 4.23, 4.32, 4.52]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["oneLine"], "text": "Since 2014, how many deals came to the Board for that yes only after the work began?", "t0": 5.52, "t1": 10.78, "shot": "b1", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "calendar", "label": "Since 2014", "sub": "votes asked for after the work began"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.25, 0.5, 1.36, 1.5, 1.67, 1.95, 2.15, 2.26, 2.38, 2.66, 2.77, 2.96, 3.26, 3.65, 3.89, 3.97, 4.15]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["amount", "established[0]", "oneLine"], "text": "297, worth 8.02 billion dollars.", "t0": 10.78, "t1": 14.11, "shot": "b2", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "297", "label": "contracts and grants", "sub": "brought for approval after they began, worth $8.02 billion"}, "emph": ["297", "8.02 billion"], "wt": [0.04, 0.23, 0.46, 1.35, 1.63, 1.87, 2.11, 2.38, 2.58, 2.9]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "caveat", "ref": ["caveat"], "text": "Each one is a lead, not a finding.", "t0": 14.63, "t1": 16.27, "shot": "b3", "visual": {"type": "caveat", "line": "This is a lead, not a finding: a pattern in public records. This film says what the records show, what they do not show, and what would settle it."}, "wt": [0.0, 0.25, 0.38, 0.51, 0.58, 0.98, 1.14, 1.21]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["established[2]", "oneLine"], "text": "The Board passed 283 of them, worth 7.16 billion dollars.", "t0": 16.39, "t1": 20.85, "shot": "b5a", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$7.16 billion", "label": "the 283 files the Board passed"}, "emph": ["283"], "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.41, 0.73, 0.94, 1.22, 1.63, 1.72, 2.35, 2.61, 2.9, 3.16, 3.38, 3.67, 4.01]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["story[3]"], "text": "By then, the work is under way. So the vote can only say yes.", "t0": 20.97, "t1": 24.01, "shot": "b6", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "gavel", "label": "The vote can only say yes", "sub": "the vendor is chosen and the work is under way", "stamp": "too late", "stampOn": "only"}, "emph": ["only"], "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.35, 0.45, 0.64, 0.75, 0.96, 1.61, 1.78, 1.88, 2.08, 2.22, 2.42, 2.62]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "chain", "ref": ["story[0]"], "text": "That’s called a retroactive vote… a yes that comes after the deal has started.", "t0": 24.13, "t1": 28.04, "shot": "b7", "visual": {"type": "chain", "kicker": "Retroactive", "steps": [{"art": "contract", "name": "City departments", "sub": "sign the deal"}, {"art": "calendar", "name": "work begins", "sub": "money can be paid"}, {"art": "gavel", "name": "Board of Supervisors", "sub": "votes yes", "late": "late"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.21, 0.43, 0.5, 1.08, 1.67, 1.83, 2.05, 2.21, 2.48, 2.83, 2.94, 3.13, 3.25]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["oneLine"], "text": "So how late is the vote, usually?", "t0": 28.16, "t1": 29.95, "shot": "b8", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "calendar", "label": "Typically", "sub": "from start date to vote"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.19, 0.34, 0.51, 0.63, 0.73, 0.97]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["oneLine", "story[2]"], "text": "About 88 days.", "t0": 29.95, "t1": 31.06, "shot": "b9", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "88", "label": "days late", "sub": "the middle case"}, "emph": ["88 days"], "wt": [0.04, 0.33, 0.73]}, {"scene": "found", "kind": "slam", "ref": ["suspicious[0]"], "text": "Five of those files caught our eye.", "t0": 31.68, "t1": 33.28, "shot": "b11", "visual": {"type": "slam", "words": ["Five", "files"], "sub": "one at a time"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.26, 0.33, 0.5, 0.82, 1.04, 1.19]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "suspicious[0].what", "established[3]"], "text": "The first is a fiber optic network.", "t0": 33.5, "t1": 35.19, "shot": "b12", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "fiber", "label": "Fiber optic network", "kicker": "The first lead", "sub": "Corporation for Network Initiatives in California", "chip": "$7.0 million to the City"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.4, 0.53, 0.62, 0.95, 1.26]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "suspicious[0].what", "established[3]"], "text": "The City is paid about 7 million dollars, for strands it supplies.", "t0": 35.31, "t1": 38.3, "shot": "b12", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "fiber", "label": "Fiber optic network", "kicker": "The first lead", "sub": "Corporation for Network Initiatives in California", "chip": "$7.0 million to the City"}, "emph": ["7 million"], "wt": [0.0, 0.11, 0.32, 0.42, 0.65, 0.88, 1.17, 1.46, 1.82, 1.99, 2.32, 2.42]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "span", "ref": ["suspicious[0].what", "suspicious[0].why"], "text": "Now follow the dates. Its term began in May 2011. It reached the Board in September 2024.", "t0": 38.42, "t1": 43.96, "shot": "b13", "visual": {"type": "span", "from": "2011-05-25", "to": "2024-09-03", "days": "4850", "fromLab": "term began", "toLab": "reached the Board", "toOn": "reached", "kicker": "The first lead"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.23, 0.5, 0.59, 1.29, 1.5, 1.74, 2.02, 2.13, 2.34, 2.61, 3.37, 3.55, 3.81, 3.91, 4.15, 4.26, 4.74, 5.0]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[0].why"], "text": "4,850 days.", "t0": 44.08, "t1": 45.79, "shot": "b15", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "4,850", "label": "days late", "sub": "already running for 162 months"}, "emph": ["4,850 days"], "wt": [0.0, 0.29, 0.66, 0.83, 1.04, 1.31]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "sfmap", "ref": ["suspicious[1]"], "text": "Next, follow the money. The second file is the Tenderloin Housing Clinic.", "t0": 46.41, "t1": 49.81, "shot": "b17", "visual": {"type": "sfmap", "hood": "Tenderloin", "hoodLabel": "Tenderloin", "zoom": "hood", "scale": 2.6, "zoomOn": "tenderloin", "kicker": "The second lead"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.28, 0.53, 0.62, 1.08, 1.25, 1.54, 1.87, 2.01, 2.12, 2.56, 2.85]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[1].what"], "text": "In December 2018, the Board was asked to approve its housing grant. How big was it?", "t0": 49.93, "t1": 55.34, "shot": "b18", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "housing", "label": "Supportive Housing Services", "kicker": "The second lead", "sub": "Tenderloin Housing Clinic"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.55, 0.81, 1.61, 1.75, 2.01, 2.15, 2.44, 2.55, 2.9, 3.02, 3.34, 4.37, 4.55, 4.74, 4.9]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[1].what"], "text": "117.3 million dollars.", "t0": 55.34, "t1": 57.57, "shot": "b19", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$117.3 million", "label": "grant for supportive housing"}, "emph": ["117.3 million"], "wt": [0.04, 0.21, 0.52, 1.03, 1.29, 1.53, 1.82]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "span", "ref": ["suspicious[1].why"], "text": "And when had its term started? July 2014. That’s 1,626 days late.", "t0": 58.09, "t1": 64.1, "shot": "b20", "visual": {"type": "span", "from": "2014-07-01", "to": "2018-12-13", "days": "1626", "fromLab": "term began", "toLab": "reached the Board", "toOn": "1,626", "kicker": "The second lead"}, "emph": ["1,626 days"], "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.28, 0.43, 0.58, 0.86, 2.01, 2.31, 2.54, 3.66, 3.92, 4.09, 4.42, 4.61, 4.84, 5.29, 5.55]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["established[4]", "suspicious[1].what"], "text": "The Board’s analyst blamed an administrative oversight and staff turnover.", "t0": 64.22, "t1": 67.69, "shot": "b20a", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "did not obtain Board of Supervisors approval for the original agreement with Tenderloin Housing Clinic in 2014", "kicker": "Budget and Legislative Analyst, file 181224"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.42, 0.91, 1.23, 1.34, 1.91, 2.47, 2.66, 2.98]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["established[4]", "notEstablished[0]"], "text": "It also reported money spent before the vote.", "t0": 67.81, "t1": 69.91, "shot": "b20b", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$71,787,816", "label": "spent in the four fiscal years before the vote"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.45, 0.84, 1.05, 1.29, 1.53, 1.63]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "suspicious[2].what"], "text": "The third file is a firm called Advocates for Human Potential.", "t0": 70.53, "t1": 73.3, "shot": "b21", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "van", "label": "Mobile Crisis Services", "kicker": "The third lead", "sub": "Advocates for Human Potential, Inc."}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.37, 0.69, 0.81, 0.88, 1.13, 1.37, 1.77, 1.9, 2.15]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[2].what", "established[3]"], "text": "As with the first, money flowed to the City. About 2 million dollars.", "t0": 73.42, "t1": 77.07, "shot": "b23", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "money", "label": "Anticipated revenue to the City", "kicker": "The third lead", "chip": "$2.0 million"}, "emph": ["to the City"], "wt": [0.0, 0.18, 0.34, 0.46, 1.07, 1.32, 1.57, 1.67, 1.77, 2.48, 2.73, 2.91, 3.19]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["f2", "suspicious[2].what"], "text": "The file doesn't explain why.", "t0": 77.19, "t1": 78.36, "shot": "b25", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Anticipated Revenue to the City of $1,977,500", "kicker": "Board file 230679"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.11, 0.33, 0.55, 0.85]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "span", "ref": ["suspicious[2].why"], "text": "The term began in September 2021. The vote came in June 2023. How late?", "t0": 78.88, "t1": 85.23, "shot": "b27", "visual": {"type": "span", "from": "2021-09-15", "to": "2023-06-06", "days": "629", "fromLab": "term began", "toLab": "reached the Board", "toOn": "june", "kicker": "The third lead"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.38, 0.73, 0.85, 1.32, 1.59, 2.52, 2.69, 2.91, 3.11, 3.24, 3.71, 4.02, 5.31, 5.53]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[2].why"], "text": "629 days.", "t0": 85.23, "t1": 86.6, "shot": "b28", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "629", "label": "days late", "sub": "already running for 21 months"}, "emph": ["629 days"], "wt": [0.04, 0.28, 0.54, 0.99]}, {"scene": "lead4", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "suspicious[3].what", "f3"], "text": "Then the same firm turned up again, with a grant agreement.", "t0": 87.22, "t1": 89.5, "shot": "b29", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "housing", "label": "Behavioral Health Bridge Housing Program", "kicker": "The fourth lead", "sub": "Advocates for Human Potential, Inc.", "chip": "$32.3 million"}, "emph": ["same firm"], "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.25, 0.49, 0.73, 0.97, 1.1, 1.42, 1.59, 1.66, 1.93]}, {"scene": "lead4", "kind": "span", "ref": ["suspicious[3].why"], "text": "It began in July 2023. The vote came in March 2024.", "t0": 89.62, "t1": 93.6, "shot": "b31", "visual": {"type": "span", "from": "2023-07-01", "to": "2024-03-12", "days": "255", "fromLab": "term began", "toLab": "reached the Board", "toOn": "march", "kicker": "The fourth lead"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.46, 0.55, 0.84, 1.11, 2.05, 2.2, 2.44, 2.65, 2.77, 3.17, 3.46]}, {"scene": "lead4", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[3].why"], "text": "255 days late.", "t0": 93.72, "t1": 95.05, "shot": "b32", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "255", "label": "days late", "sub": "already running for 8 months"}, "emph": ["255 days"], "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.41, 0.89, 1.15]}, {"scene": "lead4", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["oneLine", "established[3]"], "text": "So the lead isn’t the money. It’s the timing.", "t0": 95.57, "t1": 97.44, "shot": "b33", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "calendar", "label": "The lead is the timing", "kicker": "The fourth lead", "sub": "At least 13 of the 283 passed files bring money to the City"}, "emph": ["timing"], "wt": [0.0, 0.19, 0.33, 0.59, 0.8, 0.89, 1.2, 1.4, 1.51]}, {"scene": "lead5", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "suspicious[4].what"], "text": "One more file. The fifth is a company called Toyon Associates.", "t0": 97.66, "t1": 100.63, "shot": "b34", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "contract", "label": "Contract Amendment", "kicker": "The fifth lead", "sub": "Toyon Associates, Inc.", "chip": "$10.1 million"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.18, 0.38, 0.91, 1.06, 1.31, 1.42, 1.49, 1.79, 2.01, 2.35]}, {"scene": "lead5", "kind": "span", "ref": ["suspicious[4].why"], "text": "Its four-year extension began in March 2018. The vote came that November.", "t0": 100.75, "t1": 105.03, "shot": "b36", "visual": {"type": "span", "from": "2018-03-31", "to": "2018-11-13", "days": "227", "fromLab": "extension began", "toLab": "reached the Board", "toOn": "november", "kicker": "The fifth lead"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.2, 0.63, 1.07, 1.39, 1.51, 1.75, 2.01, 3.06, 3.22, 3.47, 3.69, 3.86]}, {"scene": "lead5", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[4].why"], "text": "227 days late.", "t0": 105.15, "t1": 106.63, "shot": "b37", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "227", "label": "days late", "sub": "the shortest delay of the five"}, "emph": ["227 days"], "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.37, 0.88, 1.14]}, {"scene": "garages", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["established[6]", "sm1", "sm2"], "text": "In 2022, the Board approved four transit-agency garage contracts set in 2011 and 2012.", "t0": 107.15, "t1": 112.64, "shot": "g1", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "gavel", "label": "Approved retroactively", "kicker": "Also on the record", "sub": "garage management, Files 220004 to 220007, 25 February 2022, at $250,129,351"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.41, 1.25, 1.38, 1.56, 1.91, 2.19, 2.96, 3.3, 3.81, 4.02, 4.11, 4.38, 4.63, 4.73, 4.98]}, {"scene": "garages", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["established[6]", "sm1", "sm2"], "text": "They were set at fees alone. What had they paid out?", "t0": 112.76, "t1": 116.06, "shot": "g2", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "calendar", "label": "Set in 2011 and 2012", "kicker": "Also on the record", "sub": "at the operators’ management fees alone: $907,920 for each of three, $587,510 for the fourth"}, "emph": ["fees alone"], "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.29, 0.51, 0.64, 0.99, 1.84, 2.03, 2.15, 2.31, 2.53]}, {"scene": "garages", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["established[6]", "sm1", "sm2"], "text": "231,349,383 dollars.", "t0": 116.06, "t1": 118.31, "shot": "g3", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$231,349,383", "label": "paid out, 2012 to January 2022", "sub": "each had passed the $10 million line by 2014-15"}, "emph": ["231,349,383"], "wt": [0.04, 0.28, 0.48, 0.7, 1.12, 1.35, 1.54, 1.82]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "unknowns", "ref": ["notEstablished[0]", "notEstablished[1]"], "text": "The records don’t show any payment made without authority. Or why each one was late.", "t0": 118.93, "t1": 123.0, "shot": "b41", "visual": {"type": "unknowns", "cards": ["That any payment was made without authority", "Why each item was late"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.44, 0.64, 0.83, 1.0, 1.32, 1.49, 1.75, 2.91, 3.1, 3.3, 3.49, 3.63, 3.79]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "settle", "ref": ["next[0]", "next[1]"], "text": "What would settle it? The payments made before each vote.", "t0": 123.12, "t1": 125.75, "shot": "b42", "visual": {"type": "settle", "cards": [{"who": "", "what": "Payment history before each approval date"}, {"who": "", "what": "Budget and Legislative Analyst report on each file"}], "focus": 0}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.32, 0.59, 1.14, 1.3, 1.69, 1.91, 2.17, 2.34]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "status", "ref": ["sources", "status"], "text": "And no one has audited the pattern as a whole.", "t0": 125.87, "t1": 127.86, "shot": "b44", "visual": {"type": "status"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.17, 0.32, 0.44, 0.6, 1.03, 1.13, 1.49, 1.61, 1.69]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "end", "ref": ["end"], "text": "A lead is a question, not an accusation.", "t0": 127.98, "t1": 129.72, "shot": "b45", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.11, 0.34, 0.43, 0.51, 0.89, 1.04, 1.14]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"open": "The question", "found": "On the record", "lead1": "Lead 1 · 4,850 days late", "lead2": "Lead 2 · $117.3 million grant", "lead3": "Lead 3 · 629 days late", "lead4": "Lead 4 · same firm again", "lead5": "Lead 5 · 227 days late", "garages": "Also · four garages", "close": "Where it stands"}, "look": "dossier", "hook": "number"}